cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "UC Davis Proteomics Core pipeline (ucdavis-proteomics-core-pipeline): an AI skill for Claude"
abstract: "A Claude Code skill for reproducible proteomics, from raw .raw/.d/.mzML files to a database search with DIA-NN, Sage or FragPipe, limpa DPC-Quant and limma differential expression, quality audits, publication Methods, an analysis report, and a full reproducibility bundle for every run. Before version 2.15 it was developed in the DE-LIMP repository (https://github.com/bsphinney/DE-LIMP)."
authors:
